DevOps Interview Command Series — Maven (Day 6) ☕

Maven is a core build & dependency management tool in DevOps pipelines.
From CI builds to artifact versioning, Maven sits at the heart of Java-based delivery.

If you’re preparing for DevOps / SRE / Cloud interviews, these are the Maven commands you must know:
 mvn -version

mvn validate
mvn compile
mvn test
mvn package
mvn install
mvn deploy

mvn clean
mvn clean install
mvn clean package

mvn test -DskipTests
mvn package -DskipTests

mvn dependency:tree
mvn dependency:list
mvn dependency:analyze

mvn help:effective-pom
mvn help:effective-settings

mvn -X
mvn -U

mvn sonar:sonar

🎯 Interview Focus
• Maven build lifecycle & phases
• Dependency conflict resolution
• Local vs remote repositories
• CI/CD integration with Jenkins/GitLab
• Debugging failed builds
• Versioning & artifact promotion
